## Stats Endpoints

- GET /api/stats/users - Get total count of all users

- GET /api/stats/super-admins - Get total count of all users with roles 'Super_Admin'
- GET /api/stats/admins - Get total count of all users with roles 'Admin'
- GET /api/stats/managers - Get total count of all users with roles 'Manager'
- GET /api/stats/vendors - Get total count of all users with roles 'Vendor'
- GET /api/stats/customers - Get total count of all users with roles 'Customer'
- GET /api/stats/marketing - Get total count of all users with roles 'Marketing'
- GET /api/stats/logistics - Get total count of all users with roles 'Logistics'
- GET /api/stats/products - Get total count of all products
- GET /api/stats/products/low-stock - Get products with stock < 10
- GET /api/stats/orders/status - Get count of orders by status
- GET /api/stats/db-stats - Get database stats including size

